<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="htmx-config" content="{&#34;allowEval&#34;:false,&#34;allowScriptTags&#34;:false,&#34;includeIndicatorStyles&#34;:false,&#34;historyEnabled&#34;:false,&#34;refreshOnHistoryMiss&#34;:false,&#34;selfRequestsOnly&#34;:true}"><title>Timeline - jb serve</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/tailwind.css"><script src="/static/htmx.min.js" defer></script></head><body><header><span class="brand">JB <b>//</b> SERVE</span> <span class="status">read-only</span><p class="note">read-only view of the evidence; no authentication; everything shown is untrusted log content</p><nav class="tabs"><a class="tab" href="/">Runs</a><a class="tab" href="/findings">Findings</a><a class="tab" href="/reputation">Reputation</a><a class="tab" href="/watch">Watch</a><a class="tab" href="/timeline" aria-current="page">Timeline</a><a class="tab" href="/estate">Estate</a></nav></header><main><h1>Timeline</h1><p class="note ctx">The saved findings and the watch cycles of every watcher, newest first. A finding is placed at the time its run was saved, not at the time of its events. A "no cycle recorded" row states that the log has no cycle line in a span; it does not say why.</p><form class="filters" role="search" action="/timeline" method="get" hx-get="/timeline" hx-trigger="change" hx-target="#timeline-results" hx-swap="innerHTML" hx-push-url="false"><label class="label">window (ending now) <select class="input" name="w"><option value="1h">1h</option><option value="6h">6h</option><option value="24h" selected>24h</option><option value="7d">7d</option></select></label> <fieldset><legend class="label">watcher (none chosen shows all)</legend> <label class="label"><input type="checkbox" name="watcher" value="_"> (unnamed)</label><label class="label"><input type="checkbox" name="watcher" value="a"> a</label></fieldset><fieldset><legend class="label">finding severity (none chosen shows all)</legend> <label class="label"><input type="checkbox" name="sev" value="info"> info</label><label class="label"><input type="checkbox" name="sev" value="check"> check</label><label class="label"><input type="checkbox" name="sev" value="activity"> activity</label><label class="label"><input type="checkbox" name="sev" value="high"> high</label><label class="label"><input type="checkbox" name="sev" value="critical"> critical</label></fieldset><noscript><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">filter</button></noscript></form><div id="timeline-results"><p class="note">Window 2026-11-04T12:00:00Z to 2026-11-05T12:00:00Z (UTC). The end is the current time rounded down to the minute.</p><div class="alert alert-muted">watcher (unnamed): interval unknown (no readable watch-status record): no gap is judged for this watcher.</div><h2>Retention</h2><ul class="note"><li>(unnamed): retention horizon unknown (no readable watch-status record).</li><li>a: findings of its runs older than 48h0m0s (before 2026-11-03T12:00:00Z) are removed by retention, so an empty finding column before then is not a result.</li></ul><h2>Lanes</h2><p class="note">One lane per watcher. A tall tick is a cycle (F: findings, I: incomplete, X: failed; a short tick is quiet). A square is a finding of high or critical severity, a ring a lower one. A dashed box is a span with no cycle line. The table below is the record.</p><figure class="static-graph"><svg viewBox="0 0 1000 160" aria-hidden="true"><text x="150" y="12">2026-11-04T12:00:00Z</text> <text x="990" y="12" text-anchor="end">2026-11-05T12:00:00Z</text> <text x="4" y="54">(unnamed)</text> <line x1="150" y1="54" x2="990" y2="54"></line> <line x1="972" y1="46" x2="972" y2="54"><title>cycle QUIET at 2026-11-05T11:30:00Z</title></line> <text x="4" y="98">a</text> <line x1="150" y1="98" x2="990" y2="98"></line> <rect x="885" y="70" width="40" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-dasharray="3 2"><title>no cycle line from 2026-11-05T09:00:00Z to 2026-11-05T10:10:00Z</title></rect> <rect x="955" y="70" width="35" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-dasharray="3 2"><title>no cycle line from 2026-11-05T11:00:00Z to now</title></rect> <line x1="885" y1="90" x2="885" y2="98"><title>cycle QUIET at 2026-11-05T09:00:00Z</title></line> <line x1="925" y1="84" x2="925" y2="98"><title>cycle FINDINGS at 2026-11-05T10:10:00Z</title></line> <text x="925" y="82" text-anchor="middle">F</text> <line x1="931" y1="76" x2="931" y2="98"><title>cycle INCOMPLETE at 2026-11-05T10:20:00Z</title></line> <text x="931" y="74" text-anchor="middle">I</text> <line x1="955" y1="76" x2="955" y2="98"><title>cycle FAILED at 2026-11-05T11:00:00Z</title></line> <text x="955" y="74" text-anchor="middle">X</text> <a href="/run?id=watch-a-20261105T100000Z"><rect x="917" y="103" width="6" height="6" fill="currentColor"><title>finding: severity high, detector authspike, tag spray:192.0.2.7</title></rect></a><text x="4" y="142">(hunt)</text> <line x1="150" y1="142" x2="990" y2="142"></line> <a href="/run?id=hunt-2"><circle cx="937" cy="150" r="3"><title>finding: severity check, detector newkey, tag k</title></circle></a></svg></figure><h2>Record</h2><table><tr><th>time (UTC)</th><th>kind</th><th>watcher</th><th>detail</th><th>run</th></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T11:30:00Z</td><td>cycle</td><td class="mono">(unnamed)</td><td>CYCLE QUIET; duration not recorded</td><td class="mono">watch-a-20261105T113000Z</td></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T11:00:00Z</td><td>cycle</td><td class="mono">a</td><td>CYCLE FAILED (not a quiet result); duration 7s</td><td class="mono">watch-a-20261105T110000Z</td></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T11:00:00Z</td><td>no cycle recorded</td><td class="mono">a</td><td>No cycle line in watch.a.log since 2026-11-05T11:00:00Z (1h0m0s until 2026-11-05T12:00:00Z). This watcher&#39;s interval is 5m0s, so this is more than 3 intervals. The log shows no cycle in this span. The cause is not known: the watcher may not have run, or its log may not have been written.</td><td class="mono">-</td></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T10:30:00Z</td><td>finding</td><td class="mono">(hunt)</td><td>severity check, detector newkey, tag k</td><td class="mono"><a href="/run?id=hunt-2">hunt-2</a></td></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T10:20:00Z</td><td>cycle</td><td class="mono">a</td><td>CYCLE INCOMPLETE (not a quiet result); gap reported: events 2026-11-05T07:00:00Z to 2026-11-05T08:00:00Z were never examined; duration not recorded</td><td class="mono">watch-a-20261105T102000Z</td></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T10:10:00Z</td><td>cycle</td><td class="mono">a</td><td>CYCLE FINDINGS; duration not recorded</td><td class="mono">watch-a-20261105T101000Z</td></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T10:00:00Z</td><td>finding</td><td class="mono">a</td><td>severity high, detector authspike, tag spray:192.0.2.7</td><td class="mono"><a href="/run?id=watch-a-20261105T100000Z">watch-a-20261105T100000Z</a></td></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T09:00:00Z</td><td>cycle</td><td class="mono">a</td><td>CYCLE QUIET; duration not recorded</td><td class="mono">watch-a-20261105T090000Z</td></tr><tr><td class="mono">2026-11-05T09:00:00Z</td><td>no cycle recorded</td><td class="mono">a</td><td>No cycle line in watch.a.log from 2026-11-05T09:00:00Z to 2026-11-05T10:10:00Z (1h10m0s). This watcher&#39;s interval is 5m0s, so this is more than 3 intervals. The log shows no cycle in this span. The cause is not known: the watcher may not have run, or its log may not have been written.</td><td class="mono">-</td></tr></table></div></main></body></html>